OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFood redistribution warehouse
OL,4,Aopens in east London
OL,5,
OL,6,FA food redistribution hub that aims to
OL,7,Fdeliver up to 10 tonnes of food to
OL,8,Fcharities and food banks each week has
OL,9,Fopened in east London.
OL,11,FThe Big Heart Food Hub in Barking will
OL,12,Fsupport more than 20 local
OL,13,Forganisations that work directly with
OL,14,Fresidents struggling with the cost of
OL,15,Fliving.
OL,17,FMost of the food will be unsold items
OL,18,Fthat would otherwise have gone to
OL,19,Fwaste, and will feed an estimated 7,000
OL,20,Fresidents each week.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
