OL,3,GNEWSAFood redistribution warehouse
OL,4,Aopens in east London
OL,5,
OL,6,FNathan Grady, charity food coordinator,
OL,7,Fsaid: "We are statistically the poorest
OL,8,Fborough in London and we recognise that
OL,9,Fthere's a big need. People are missing
OL,10,Fmeals - children are missing meals."
